### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:scene1 a ex:TrafficScene ;
    ex:hasEntity ex:vehicle1, ex:building1, ex:building2, ex:street1, ex:streetlight1 ;
    
ex:vehicle1 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasType "Car" ;
    ex:isApproaching ex:vehicle2 .

ex:vehicle2 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasType "Car" ;
    ex:isFollowing ex:vehicle1 .

ex:building1 a ex:Building ;
    ex:hasCondition "Old" ;
    ex:isNear ex:street1 .

ex:building2 a ex:Building ;
    ex:hasCondition "Old" ;
    ex:isNear ex:street1 .

ex:street1 a ex:Road ;
    ex:hasCondition "Paved" ;
    ex:hasLighting "Low" ;
    ex:hasWeather "Clear" ;

ex:streetlight1 a ex:StreetLight ;
    ex:hasStatus "Off" ;
    ex:isNear ex:street1 .
```

